                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Welp.  My inventory all but vanished and I can't finish the game.\n\nI am not restarting this...  That's enough.\n\nI can't say this is a bad game.  I actually liked the mystery/story and the Shadow H.O. scenes were rather hard too.  Ya really had to think/find the right spot.\n\nBut...\n\nThe game has plenty of bugs (see other reviews) and there are some misspelled items.  There is literally an item called \"Ring\"...  But it's a \"Bell\"...  I mean...  It makes a \"Ring-ing\" sound...  But no.\n\nEh meh.\n\nGreat.  Now I also have to come up with my own ending too.  :(",
